  "markdown": "○\n中国銀行\nBANK OF CHINA\n\n\n2026年中期业绩发布\n2026. 08. 28\n\n\n<!-- PAGE BREAK -->\n\n○\n中國銀行\nBANK OF CHINA\n\n\n除特别说明以外，本演示文稿财务数据采用国际财务报告会计准则编制。\n本演示稿及后续讨论可能包含涉及风险和不确定因素的前瞻性陈述。这些陈述\n通常使用“相信”“预计”“预期”“估计”“计划”“预测”“目标”“可\n能”“将”等前瞻性术语来表述。阁下不应过分依赖该等仅适用于本演示稿发\n表日的前瞻性陈述。这些前瞻性陈述的依据是我们自己的信息和我们认为可靠\n的其他来源的信息。该等前瞻性陈述与日后事件或本行日后财务、业务或其他\n表现有关，并受若干可能会导致实际结果出现重大差异的不确定因素的影响。\n\n\n<figure type=\"ILLUSTRATION\">\n\n<description>A stylized, minimalist illustration of the Bank of China Tower in Hong Kong. The building is rendered in shades of light pink and white, featuring its iconic angular, triangular structural facade. The design is symmetrical, with the building tapering upwards to a central spire. The sides of the structure are composed of vertical lines, creating a geometric pattern that fades into a white background at the bottom.</description></figure>\n\n<!-- PAGE BREAK -->\n\n2\n0\n2\n6\n\n\n» “A+H” 上市20周年 \n现代公司治理 \n全球化经营 \n综合化转型 \n资产规模 \n增长约8倍  ↗\n境外机构覆盖的国家和地区 \n由27个拓展至64个  ↗\n多轮经济周期中 \n保持稳健经营 \n\n» “十四五” 圆满收官，“十五五” 良好开局 \n\n营业收入、净利润: 连续五年正增长 \n\n净息差在主要同业中: 率先企稳 \n\n非利息收入占比: 升至33% \n\n资产、负债增幅: 超过50% \n\n不良率保持主要同业: 最优水平 \n\n境外机构利润贡献度: 提升4.6个百分点 \n\n3\n\n\n<!-- PAGE BREAK -->\n\n[○]\n中國銀行\nBANK OF CHINA\n\n\n01 / 业绩回顾\n02 / 上半年重点工作\n03 / 规划和展望\n\n\n<!-- PAGE BREAK -->\n\n⊞ 经营效益稳步增长\n\n\n<figure type=\"CHART\">\n\n<description>This chart illustrates the revenue growth between the first half of 2025 (1H2025) and the first half of 2026 (1H2026). The chart features a header titled \"营业收入\" (Operating Revenue) with a unit of \"百万元人民币\" (Million RMB). It shows a percentage increase of +8.41% indicated by an arrow pointing from the 1H2025 data point to the 1H2026 data point. The chart displays two vertical cylindrical bars representing the revenue values for the two periods.</description><table><thead><tr><th>Period</th><th>Revenue (Million RMB)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1H2025</td><td>329,418</td></tr><tr><td>1H2026</td><td>357,113</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n<figure type=\"CHART\">本行股东应享税后利润 百万元人民币 1H2025 117,591 1H2026 123,594 +5.10% \n\n<description>This chart illustrates the growth in 'Net Profit Attributable to Shareholders' (本行股东应享税后利润) in millions of RMB. It is a column chart comparing two periods: 1H2025 and 1H2026. The 1H2025 column is grey with a value of 117,591. The 1H2026 column is red with a value of 123,594. An upward-curving red arrow connects the two columns, annotated with a growth percentage of +5.10%. The chart background features a light grid pattern.</description> <table><thead><tr><th>Period</th><th>Net Profit (Million RMB)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1H2025</td><td>117,591</td></tr><tr><td>1H2026</td><td>123,594</td></tr><tr><td>Growth</td><td>+5.10%</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n<figure type=\"CHART\">拨备前利润 (Pre-provision profit) 百万元人民币 (in million RMB). \n\n<description>This is a column chart showing the growth of pre-provision profit between 1H2025 and 1H2026. The chart features two cylindrical columns on a grid background. The first column represents 1H2025 with a value of 209,922, and the second column represents 1H2026 with a value of 230,435. A red arrow pointing upward connects the two values, indicating a growth of +9.77%.</description> <table><thead><tr><th>Period</th><th>Pre-provision Profit (Million RMB)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1H2025</td><td>209,922</td></tr><tr><td>1H2026</td><td>230,435</td></tr><tr><td>Growth</td><td>+9.77%</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n<figure type=\"CHART\">\n\n<description>This chart illustrates the change in net interest margin (净息差) from 2025 to the first half of 2026 (1H2026). It depicts an increase of 1 basis point (+1个基点), rising from 1.26% to 1.27%. The visualization uses two vertical bars on a grid background: a grey bar representing 2025 and a pink bar representing 1H2026, with a curved red arrow indicating the upward trend.</description><table><tr><td>Period</td><td>Net Interest Margin</td></tr><tr><td>2025</td><td>1.26%</td></tr><tr><td>1H2026</td><td>1.27%</td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<figure type=\"CHART\">\n\n<description>A bar chart titled \"税后利润\" (Net Profit After Tax) showing financial growth between 1H2025 and 1H2026. The values are in \"百万元人民币\" (Millions of RMB). The chart displays a growth of +4.67%, with an arrow pointing from the 1H2025 bar to the 1H2026 bar. The 1H2025 bar is grey, and the 1H2026 bar is red.</description><table><thead><tr><th>Period</th><th>Net Profit After Tax (Millions RMB)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1H2025</td><td>126,138</td></tr><tr><td>1H2026</td><td>132,031</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n<figure type=\"CHART\">### 成本收入比 (Cost-to-Income Ratio)\n\n\n\n<description>A bar chart illustrating the change in cost-to-income ratio between the first half of 2025 (1H2025) and the first half of 2026 (1H2026). The chart shows a decrease of 1.68 percentage points, with a downward-pointing arrow indicating the trend. The first bar (1H2025) is light grey and represents 25.11%. The second bar (1H2026) is a gradient of pink to white and represents 23.43%.</description>\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th>Period</th>\n    <th>Value</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>1H2025</td>\n    <td>25.11%</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>1H2026</td>\n    <td>23.43%</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Change</td>\n    <td>-1.68 percentage points</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n注: 按中国企业会计准则计算</figure>\n\n5\n\n\n<!-- PAGE BREAK -->\n\n○\n资产负债稳进提质\n\n\n<figure type=\"CHART\">\n\n<description>The figure is a financial infographic titled \"Liabilities\" (负债), displayed in billions of RMB (十亿元人民币). It features a bar chart comparing data between 2025 and 1H2026, showing an increase of 5.11%.</description><table><tr><th>Year</th><th>Value</th></tr><tr><td>2025</td><td>35,150</td></tr><tr><td>1H2026</td><td>36,946</td></tr></table>\n\n<description>Below the chart, there is a highlighted statement: \"Significant effectiveness in liability cost control\" (负债成本管控成效显著). Two supplementary text boxes provide further financial context:</description><ul><li>Left box: \"Offshore institutional active deposit ratio: Increase\" (境外机构活期存款占比 提升)</li><li>Right box: \"Domestic RMB deposit interest rate: Decreased by 22 basis points compared to the previous year\" (境内人民币存款付息率较上年下降 22个基点)</li></ul></figure>\n\n<figure type=\"CHART\">This figure displays financial data related to assets and their structure. \n\n<description>The figure consists of a primary bar chart at the top showing asset growth and a secondary section at the bottom highlighting asset structure optimization.</description>\n\n### Asset Growth Chart\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th>Category</th>\n    <th>2025</th>\n    <th>1H2026</th>\n    <th>Growth</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Assets (in billions of RMB)</td>\n    <td>38,358</td>\n    <td>40,186</td>\n    <td>+4.77%</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n### Asset Structure Optimization\n\n\n<description>The lower section indicates positive trends in asset structure with two key metrics:</description>\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th>Metric</th>\n    <th>Value</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Loans and investments ratio (percentage points)</td>\n    <td>+1.32</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Domestic institution RMB loans (trillions of RMB)</td>\n    <td>+1.20 (+5.98% growth)</td>\n  </tr>\n</table></figure>\n\n6\n\n\n<!-- PAGE BREAK -->\n\n○\n资产质量整体稳定\n\n\n### 资产质量\n\n较上年末\n\n不良贷款率: 1.22% -0.01个 百分点\n\n不良贷款 拨备覆盖率: 200.85% +0.48个 百分点\n\n集团新发生不良 同比下降\n\n境外机构不良贷款余额、不良率继续“双降”\n\n### 资本水平 \n\n核一级资本充足率: 12.04% \n\n一级资本充足率: 13.65% \n\n资本充足率: 18.31% \n\n• 成功发行300亿元无固定期限资本债券和1,000亿元\n\n• 总损失吸收能力 (TLAC) 风险加权比率满足监管要求 \n\n7\n\n\n<!-- PAGE BREAK -->\n\n○\n股东回报实现提升\n\n\n上市以来，累计现金分红**超万亿元**\n派息比例多年保持在**30%**的较高水平\n\n\n<figure type=\"DIAGRAM\">\n\n<description>The figure consists of two circular, stylized graphical elements arranged in a sequence. The first element on the left features a large, red-outlined circle containing the text '2025年' (Year 2025). Surrounding this circle are concentric partial arcs, with a dotted arc on the left and a solid red arc on the bottom. To the right of this circle is the text: '创新为H股股东提供人民币派息币种选择权' (Innovate to provide H-share shareholders with the option of RMB dividend currency). The second element, positioned partially behind and to the right, is another circular graphic containing the text '2026年上半年' (First half of 2026). A red line extends from the right of this second circle towards the edge of the image.</description></figure>\n\n<figure type=\"DIAGRAM\">\n\n<description>A stylized graphic centered on the text \"2024年\". The text is enclosed within a solid red circle. Surrounding this central circle are two concentric arc-like elements. The outer arc is a solid red curved line forming the top-left portion of a circle, while the inner arc is a dashed gray line forming the remaining portion of that same circle. Below this, there is a second, larger solid red arc forming the bottom-right portion of a circle, which creates a dynamic, circular framing effect around the central year.</description></figure>\n\n开始增加中期分红\n让投资者提早分享经营成果\n\n\n董事会建议派发普通股中期股利<sup>注</sup>\n每10股1.190元(税前) 同比增长8.8%\n分红比例提升至 31% ↗\n\n\n注：须待本行股东会批准后生效\n\n\n8\n\n\n<!-- PAGE BREAK -->\n\n[○]\n中國銀行\nBANK OF CHINA\n\n\n01 / 业绩回顾\n02 / 上半年重点工作\n03 / 规划和展望\n\n\n<!-- PAGE BREAK -->\n\nⓉ 坚持“向优”发展，全球化业务竞争力保持领先\n\n\n<figure type=\"DIAGRAM\">\n\n<description>The figure is a conceptual diagram superimposed on a world map, illustrating China's global network layout and its efforts to promote the international use of the Renminbi (RMB). The title at the top reads: \"持续扩大全球化网络布局优势，全面助力人民币国际使用\" (Continuously expanding the advantages of the global network layout and comprehensively assisting in the international use of the Renminbi).</description>\n\n### Left Side: Network Coverage\n- **\"网络覆盖广泛\" (Extensive Network Coverage)**\n- **Nodes/Labels on Map:**\n  - \"45个共建“一带一路”国家\" (45 \"Belt and Road\" co-construction countries)\n  - \"G20成员国\" (G20 member countries)\n  - \"亚太经合组织 (APEC)\" (Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation)\n  - \"金砖五国\" (BRICS)\n  - \"东盟十国\" (ASEAN)\n- **Arrows:** Two curved arrows point from \"中国\" (China) towards the \"亚太经合组织 (APEC)\" node and surrounding regions.\n- **Bottom Left:** \"机构牌照齐全\" (Complete Institutional Licenses): \"覆盖商行、证券、保险、资管、投资、租赁、消费金融等领域\" (Covering commercial banking, securities, insurance, asset management, investment, leasing, consumer finance, and other fields).\n\n### Right Side: Financial Services and Performance\n- **\"金融服务优质高效\" (High-quality and Efficient Financial Services)**\n  - \"增至19个\" (Increased to 19): \"人民币清算行\" (RMB clearing banks)\n  - \"380亿元\" (38 billion RMB): \"熊猫债承销\" (Panda bond underwriting)\n  - \"超1,100亿元\" (Over 110 billion RMB): \"协助境外发行人人民币直接融资\" (Assisting overseas issuers with direct RMB financing)\n\n- **\"领先优势扩大\" (Expanding Leading Advantages)**\n  - \"熊猫债、自贸离岸债、离岸人民币债券承销量\" (Underwriting volume of Panda bonds, free trade offshore bonds, and offshore RMB bonds)\n\n- **\"跨境核心业务优势断层领先\" (Cross-border Core Business Advantages Leading by a Significant Margin)**\n  - \"2.61万亿美元\" (2.61 trillion USD): \"境内分行国际结算量\" (International settlement volume of domestic branches) - \"同比增长22.73%\" (Year-on-year growth 22.73%)\n  - \"11万亿元\" (11 trillion RMB): \"跨境人民币结算量\" (Cross-border RMB settlement volume) - \"同比增长29.15%\" (Year-on-year growth 29.15%)</figure>\n\n10\n\n\n<!-- PAGE BREAK -->\n\n⊕\n坚持\n“向优”\n发展，\n全球化业务竞争力保持领先\n\n\n<figure type=\"DIAGRAM\">\n\n<description>The figure is a business infographic titled 'Fully leverage the advantages of the global service ecosystem, actively serve 'going out' and 'bringing in''. It outlines the evolution of services from a '1.0 Model' to a '2.0 Model'.</description> \n\n### 1.0 Model: Basic Customer Needs \n- Consists of three stacked, oval-shaped icons labeled: \n  - '存' (Deposit) \n  - '贷' (Loan) \n  - '汇' (Remittance) \n\n### 2.0 Model: High Value-Added, Comprehensive Integrated Services \nThis section features five columns of services, each with an icon at the top: \n\n1. **Accelerate the construction of corporate 'going out' service system** \n   - Text: Support Chinese enterprises 'going out' loan steady growth \n2. **Full-process assistance for cross-border investment and attraction** \n   - Text: Serving foreign-invested enterprises in China, over 330,000 households \n3. **Pioneering 7x24 hour multi-currency global capital pool** \n   - Text: 24-hour service, second-level fund transfer, covering all 'going out' enterprises and over 90% of multinational companies \n4. **The first Chinese-funded global custodian bank** \n   - Text: \n     - Overseas custody scale growth: 16.20% \n     - Cross-border custody scale growth: 19.38% \n5. **Upgrade 'BOC Global Payroll' service** \n   - Text: Covering over 20 currencies, serving nearly 3,000 'going out' enterprises \n\n### Bottom Summary Section (Market Coverage and Business Scale) \n- **Overseas Chinese-funded enterprises served:** Over 30,000 \n- **Fortune 500 foreign enterprises in China service coverage:** Over 90% \n- **Overseas individual customers served:** Over 8.5 million \n- **Market position:** Leading market position in coverage and business scale for overseas sovereign institutions and large overseas financial institutions.</figure>\n\n11\n\n\n<!-- PAGE BREAK -->\n\n⓴ 坚持 “向优” 发展，全球化业务竞争力保持领先\n\n\n<figure type=\"DIAGRAM\">\n\n<description>The figure is a strategic diagram titled '积极强化组织体系优势，全面提升全球化发展支持保障能力' (Actively strengthen organizational system advantages, comprehensively improve globalization development support and guarantee capabilities). It is divided into two main columns: '业务精细化管理' (Business Refinement Management) on the left and '全球化人才队伍' (Globalization Talent Team) and '境外合规风控体系' (Overseas Compliance Risk Control System) on the right. </description>## Left Column: 业务精细化管理\nThis section uses a three-tier layout representing levels of organizational integration:\n\n1. **区域化 (Regionalization)**:\n   - Row contains: '中银香港' (Bank of China Hong Kong), a red circle labeled '区域总部' (Regional Headquarters), and '中银欧洲' (Bank of China Europe).\n2. **集约化 (Intensification)**:\n   - Row contains: '南宁' (Nanning), a red circle labeled '共享服务中心' (Shared Service Center), and '匈牙利' (Hungary).\n3. **一体化 (Integration)**:\n   - Bottom section contains a text block: '在全球如伦敦、纽约、新加坡、中国香港等地设有25个一体化管理的业务中心' (There are 25 integrated management business centers globally in places such as London, New York, Singapore, Hong Kong, etc.).\n   - Below the text, there is a grid of rounded rectangular labels: '交易中心' (Trading Center), '银团贷款中心' (Syndicated Loan Center), '科技信息中心' (Technology Information Center), '资金内控中台' (Treasury Internal Control Middle Office), '大宗商品业务中心' (Commodity Business Center), '债券承分销中心' (Bond Underwriting and Distribution Center), and '......'.\n\n## Right Column\n### Top Section: 全球化人才队伍 (Globalization Talent Team)\n- A horizontal row of rounded rectangles: '国际视野开阔' (Broad International Vision), '跨文化沟通顺畅' (Smooth Cross-cultural Communication), '专业能力扎实' (Solid Professional Ability).\n- Below this, two circled annotations: '1万余人 外派人才库规模' (Over 10,000 people, scale of dispatched talent pool) and '持续保持同业领先 关键领域人才储备' (Continuously maintain industry leadership, talent reserves in key areas).\n\n### Bottom Section: 境外合规风控体系 (Overseas Compliance Risk Control System)\n- '进一步推动' (Further Promote) connects to '境外合规管理长效机制建设' (Construction of long-term mechanism for overseas compliance management).\n- '进一步做好' (Further Do Well) connects to '境外机构风险策略“一行一策”重检' (Re-examination of 'one policy for one bank' risk strategy for overseas institutions).</figure>\n\n12\n\n\n<!-- PAGE BREAK -->\n\n⊕\n坚持\n“向新”发展，\n服务实体经济有力有效\n\n\n扎实做好“五篇大文章”\n科技金融\n绿色金融\n- 贷款余额在对公贷款占比超1/3\n- 授信户数20万户\n- 在银行业市场承销科技创新债券\n442亿元\n- 服务超5,200家人工智能产业链\n- 核心企业，提供综合金融支持超\n6,600亿元\n- 参与设立京津冀创业投资引导基\n金，在上海、西安设立科创母基\n金\n普惠金融\n- 贷款余额3.06万亿元，增长\n10.60%\n- 贷款户数198.75万户，增长8.19%\n- 累计为6.10万户国家级、省级“专\n精特新”中小企业贷款9,291亿元\n- 向稳岗扩岗企业发放专项贷款超\n3,900亿元\n- 涉